abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and technical white paper for a
  next-generation multi-modal Automated Biometric Identification
  System (ABIS) with fully passive Presentation Attack Detection
  (PAD). Combines Vision Transformer (ViT) biometric encoders,
  Vision-Language Model (VLM) semantic liveness guardrails,
  temporal rPPG deepfake rejection, flash-induced surface diffusion
  analysis, and two-tier vector retrieval (IVF-HNSW + Product
  Quantization triage with classical geometric precision
  verification).

